# review-empty: the agent's branch turns scripts/ into a package with an empty __init__.py,
# touches app/service.py and worker/main.go, and adds an empty py.typed, the review's last file.
# c stops on every file in turn, the empty ones included, and ticks each as it leaves it; the
# last c ticks py.typed and ends the review. C walks back through them the same way (#720).
merl README.md
wait # orders
run git switch -q -c typed && : > scripts/__init__.py && : > py.typed && printf '\n# Refunds go through the service.\n' >> app/service.py && printf '\n// Retries back off: see the queue.\n' >> worker/main.go && git add -A && git commit -qm typed
merl --review
wait hunk 1/1  file 1/4
caption c stops on the empty scripts/__init__.py like on any other file (#720)
key c
wait scripts/__init__.py  1:1
key c
wait hunk 1/1  file 3/4
caption the review's last file is empty: c opens it, c again ticks it and ends the review
key c
wait py.typed  1:1
key c
wait last hunk of the review
caption C walks back through the empty file too
key C C
wait scripts/__init__.py  1:1
